      "handle": "timstebbins.bsky.social",
      "author": "Tim Stebbins",
      "team": "ガーディアンズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Stephen Vogt was asked directly about his status and the rumors connecting him to the Mariners' managerial opening during the Guardians end-of-season media availability today. “I'll be in Cleveland,”  Vogt said. “I'm here. I'm coming back.”",
      "likes": 40,
      "reposts": 6,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-10-22T21:00:20.469Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:jrwmzzblbtbegomwff262gv4/app.bsky.feed.post/3myiknguld22f",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "I loved all the podcasts saying \"Vogt's job is in trouble for mismanaging pitching in the playoffs\" and now they've quickly pivoted to fears he'll leave.",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "desarch.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "No one wants to play with Josh Naylor.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "dukejeopardy.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "スティーブン・ヴォグトはガーディアンズのシーズン終了会見で、自身の去就とマリナーズ監督就任の噂について直接問われ、「私はクリーブランドにいる。ここにいるし、戻ってくる」と語った。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "The Cubs, for a 2nd consecutive year, earned the Fielding Bible Award for best defensive team. Alex Bregman won their award for MLB third basemen.",
      "likes": 41,
      "reposts": 5,
      "replies": 1,
      "at": "2026-10-22T20:11:14.162Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myihvn2hek2r",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "カブスが2年連続でFielding Bible賞の最優秀守備チームに選出。サードのアレックス・ブレグマンも同賞の三塁手部門を受賞した。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "mmontemurro.bsky.social",
      "author": "Meghan Montemurro",
      "team": "カブス",
      "outlet": "Chicago Tribune",
      "text": "Pete Crow-Armstrong is named the MLB Defensive Player of the Year for Fielding Bible Awards. Boston's Ceddanne Rafaela won their CF award after he & PCA tied in points and both had same break down of 1st-3rd place votes. Defensive Runs Saved was last tiebreaker, giving it to Ceddanne.",
      "likes": 38,
      "reposts": 2,
      "replies": 3,
      "at": "2026-10-22T20:09:57.620Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:nbtbg72x4ai35yy2mmx4o2mb/app.bsky.feed.post/3myihte2ld22r",
      "jp_players": [],
      "reply_texts": [
        {
          "text": "Congrats to Ceddanne on taking home the CF award, I think it's awesome that he and Pete were so close in the voting - both players have been playing some incredible defense this season!",
          "likes": 2,
          "author": "churchandbaseball.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "So Rafaela was the better CF but PCA was the better defender? How does that work? Or was this just a way to recognize the two best defenders?",
          "likes": 1,
          "author": "drmag00.bsky.social"
        },
        {
          "text": "A tiebreaker coming down to Defensive Runs Saved is the nerdiest and best way to settle it.",
          "likes": 0,
          "author": "boxingmetrics.bsky.social"
        }
      ],
      "jp": "ピート・クロウ＝アームストロングがFielding Bible賞のMLB年間最優秀守備選手に。センター部門はポイントも1〜3位票の内訳も並んだセダン・ラファエラ（レッドソックス）が受賞。最後は守備防御点の差で決着した。"
    },
